        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating multiple Python files for a text content safety task set using Google's services. The files are divided into same-scenario scored files, local helper files, and later-step scored files. Each scored file must use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. The local helper files will contain configuration and utility functions. I will start by creating the initial file `moderate_text.py` using Google's services. </thinking>\n",
